        <headline>Severe Thunderstorm Warning issued September 24 at 5:49PM CDT until September 24 at 6:00PM CDT by NWS Midland/Odessa TX</headline>
        <description>At 548 PM CDT, a severe thunderstorm was located 11 miles southwest
of Mentone, moving northeast at 25 mph.

HAZARD...60 mph wind gusts and nickel size hail.

SOURCE...Radar indicated.

IMPACT...Expect damage to roofs, siding, and trees.

This severe thunderstorm will remain over mainly rural areas of
northwestern Reeves County.
</description>
        <instruction>For your protection move to an interior room on the lowest floor of a
building.</instruction>
